## 5. Store listings

Create the apps in Play Console and App Store Connect with the ids above
before the first production upload. The Play upload targets the
`internal` track; promote by hand.

## 6. Codemagic (alternative)

These templates target GitHub Actions + Fastlane. Codemagic can run the
same flavor/sign/publish steps if the team prefers a hosted Flutter CI; no
`codemagic.yaml` is generated.
